From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sun4i: Drive the TD4322 with TE-triggered command frames

Use the supplier's TD4322 initialization sequence and RGB888 mode.
Set up a DCS packet per scanline, then arm DSI and the TCON from the
panel TE GPIO. Serialize backlight writes with the shared sequencer.

The register sequence follows the sun8iw20 DSI 4.0 code in Allwinner's
disp2 lowlevel_v2x (de_dsi.c, de_lcd_sun50iw10.c and disp_al.c).

Signed-off-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
